# User Context (Always Apply)

## Who the user is
- Vishal Chaudhari (Pune, India), Product Manager with ~12 years of experience.
- Goal: become an AI-Native Product Manager using Claude Code (primary) and Cursor (secondary) for hands-on learning and building.

## Domain focus
- Fintech: MSME lending, rural payments/banking enablement, DS-driven sales/distributor productivity, Account Aggregator ecosystem, risk/fraud/collections workflows.

## Current strengths to leverage
- Strong PRD + execution discipline; cross-functional leadership (Eng/Design/QA/Data/Sales/Ops).
